performance as the source for determining the Group&#8217;s reportable segments. The Group&#8217;s CODM reviews consolidated results including
revenue and operating income at a consolidated level. This resulted in only <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfReportableSegments" scale="0" unitRef="segment" id="ixv-7533">one</ix:nonFraction> reportable segment in the Group: (1) Bulk trading business
of peripheral products such as pipeline monitoring components.</p></ix:continuation>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

